msgid "Carthaginians built their city walls in three concentric circuits. These walls were never breached. Even when the city was taken by the Romans, it was via the city's harbor, not by storming its walls."
msgstr "Els cartaginesos van construir les seves muralles en tres circuits concèntrics. Aquestes muralles no van ser mai violades. Fins i tot quan els romans van prendre la ciutat, va ser pel port, no enderrocant les muralles."

msgid "Carthaginians established many trading centers as colonies and ultimately held dominion over 300 cities and towns in North Africa alone."
msgstr "Els cartaginesos van establir molts centres de comerç com a colònies i van arribar a dominar més de 300 ciutats només al nord d'Àfrica."

